OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder after street stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder over an incident in
OL,8,FGlasgow last week that left another
OL,9,Fteenager in hospital.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FNorham Street in Shawlands at about
OL,13,F19:20 on 11 November.
OL,15,FA 17-year-old boy was taken to hospital
OL,16,Ffor treatment for reported knife wounds
OL,17,Fand the 15-year-old was arrested.
OL,19,FHe is expected to appear at Glasgow
OL,20,FSheriff Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
